title: "Tendon-Driven Continuum Robot Platform"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Nour Edeen"
    given-names: "Mohamad"

repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamad-nouredeen/tdcr-cosserat-robot-platform"

abstract: >
  MATLAB implementations, mechanical design files, actuation software,
  electronics documentation, and preliminary experimental evaluation
  for a single-segment tendon-driven continuum robot based on
  Cosserat-rod modeling.

keywords:
